     1985   field id as integer
     1986   field line as integer
     1987   field hist-mode as character
     1988   field des as character
     1989   field num-recs as integer
     1990   field option_ as character
     1991   field item_ as character
     1992   field status_ as character
     1993   field num-add as integer
     1994   field num-ignored as integer
